            "description": "The brief's GET /api/accounts/{id}. Every money field comes back as an INTEGER NUMBER OF CENTS: a balance of 123456 means 1,234.56. JSON integers are exact, so nothing is lost in the browser the way a fractional number would be."
          }
        },
